{
  "title": "低估值老登板块的上涨非常健康！轮动反弹还会持续",
  "author": "顶底之王",
  "publish_time": "",
  "url": "http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxODM4ODM5Mg==&mid=2247487020&idx=1&sn=6ee6b6db926f5e2bf8c9879196d24b15&chksm=f879cadfae2c480ef66cc6c9ce94ad5c8f6cd889515e01dc356b559a251ce252c4104eca2be2&scene=27#wechat_redirect",
  "content_text": "低估值老登板块今天的上涨非常健康！\n医药今天放量有点大，要先回调整理一下。但消费白酒，农业猪肉等其他板块走势都正常。后几天应该就是老登内部轮动上涨。\n之前是科技涨，吸老登的血。接下来可能要反过来了。\n科技方向我就不做预判了，韩国股市和创业板低点都已经被跌破。\n虽然科创50，半导体还是上涨趋势，但我也不建议做。\n原因说过很多次，估值过高，拥挤度过高，位置相对过高。\n没法大资金，也没法重仓，只能轻仓短线，赚也赚不到多少钱。\n指数上呢，如果低估值板块上涨的同时，科技能再起行情，那指数也会大涨。\n但现在市场没那么多增量资金，普涨难度很大。\n那大概率还是像今天这样，低估值板块上涨，是要科技里的资金出局，那一边儿涨一边儿跌，指数还是震荡。\n至于科技还能不能再涨一波，老登再跌，我判断概率很低。\n顶底迹象之前的视频都发过。\n而且至少从现在的盘面来看，短期老登板块的上涨还没涨完。\n刘广义\nA0260626040026\n投资有风险 入市需谨慎\n个人观点 仅供参考\n案例截图不做投资依据\n上海中广云证券咨询有限公司",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \"><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">低估值老登板块今天的上涨非常健康！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">医药今天放量有点大，要先回调整理一下。但消费白酒，农业猪肉等其他板块走势都正常。后几天应该就是老登内部轮动上涨。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">之前是科技涨，吸老登的血。接下来可能要反过来了。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">科技方向我就不做预判了，韩国股市和创业板低点都已经被跌破。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">虽然科创50，半导体还是上涨趋势，但我也不建议做。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">原因说过很多次，估值过高，拥挤度过高，位置相对过高。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">没法大资金，也没法重仓，只能轻仓短线，赚也赚不到多少钱。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">指数上呢，如果低估值板块上涨的同时，科技能再起行情，那指数也会大涨。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">但现在市场没那么多增量资金，普涨难度很大。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">那大概率还是像今天这样，低估值板块上涨，是要科技里的资金出局，那一边儿涨一边儿跌，指数还是震荡。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">至于科技还能不能再涨一波，老登再跌，我判断概率很低。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">顶底迹象之前的视频都发过。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">而且至少从现在的盘面来看，短期老登板块的上涨还没涨完。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style='-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">刘广义</span></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);